{
  "TK1": {
    "title": "Charitable Illusion & Political Blind Spots of Peoples Temple",
    "theme": "The Halo Effect & Political Blind Spots",
    "hook": "Rainbow family, soup kitchens, political alliances. Why was an entire city completely blinded?",
    "total_dur_est": 58.5,
    "bgm": "bgm_cello_sad.mp3",
    "sfx": [
      "amb_wind_cold.wav (bed)",
      "fx_crowd_applause.wav",
      "fx_stinger.wav"
    ],
    "overlay": [
      {
        "after_id": "TK1.01#1",
        "text": "PEOPLES TEMPLE · SAN FRANCISCO 1970S",
        "dur_s": 3.0
      },
      {
        "after_id": "TK1.01#3",
        "text": "CHAIRMAN OF SF HOUSING AUTHORITY",
        "dur_s": 2.5
      },
      {
        "after_id": "TK1.01#4",
        "text": "HALO EFFECT & POLITICAL BLIND SPOTS",
        "dur_s": 2.5
      },
      {
        "after_id": "TK1.01#6",
        "text": "OVERSIGHT PARALYZED BY FEAR OF BACKLASH",
        "dur_s": 2.5
      },
      {
        "after_id": "TK1.01#7",
        "text": "CHARITABLE MASK HIDING TOTALITARIAN EMPIRE",
        "dur_s": 3.0
      }
    ],
    "lines": [
      {
        "id": "TK1.01#1",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.6,
        "text": "Its founder, James Warren Jones, built a reputation as a passionate humanitarian by opening soup kitchens, elderly care homes, and rehabilitation centers for the marginalized.",
        "source": "1.04#3",
        "bg": "t12_racial_harmony_facade",
        "camera": "still",
        "dur_est": 8.92
      },
      {
        "id": "TK1.01#2",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.6,
        "text": "He adopted children of diverse racial backgrounds, proudly presenting his household as the “Rainbow Family” to showcase his humanitarian ideals.",
        "source": "1.04#4",
        "bg": "t12_racial_harmony_facade",
        "camera": "pan",
        "dur_est": 7.14
      },
      {
        "id": "TK1.01#3",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.6,
        "text": "Shielded by his pristine philanthropic veneer, he forged close ties with top California politicians and was appointed Chairman of the San Francisco Housing Authority.",
        "source": "1.04#6",
        "bg": "t12_charity_soup_kitchen_bread",
        "camera": "push",
        "dur_est": 8.56
      },
      {
        "id": "TK1.01#4",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.6,
        "text": "This “Halo Effect” combined with a massive political blindspot of the era to construct an invisible protective shield around the organization.",
        "source": "1.04#7",
        "bg": "t12_san_francisco_temple_expansion",
        "camera": "still",
        "dur_est": 7.49
      },
      {
        "id": "TK1.01#5",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.6,
        "text": "In the post-civil rights era, politicians yearned for a symbol of racial harmony and relied heavily on the disciplined voting bloc of thousands of loyal devotees.",
        "source": "1.04#8",
        "bg": "t12_san_francisco_temple_expansion",
        "camera": "pan",
        "dur_est": 9.28
      },
      {
        "id": "TK1.01#6",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.6,
        "text": "This intense fear of public reproach effectively paralyzed institutional oversight, causing glaring red flags to be deliberately overlooked for years.",
        "source": "1.04#10",
        "bg": "t12_city_hall_political_alliances",
        "camera": "push",
        "dur_est": 7.14
      },
      {
        "id": "TK1.01#7",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.0,
        "text": "Yet beneath that glamorous humanitarian tapestry lay an authoritarian fortress governed by physical intimidation and total psychological coercion.",
        "source": "1.06#1",
        "bg": "t12_iron_fist_behind_velvet_curtain",
        "camera": "still",
        "dur_est": 6.42
      }
    ]
  },
  "TK2": {
    "title": "Jungle Paradise or Closed Psychological Prison?",
    "theme": "Social Isolation & Familial Severing",
    "hook": "Homes sold, passports confiscated. When paradise turned into an inescapable jungle cage.",
    "total_dur_est": 57.8,
