    "lines": [
      {
        "id": "TK2.01#1",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.6,
        "text": "Jim Jones secretly conducted brutal collective interrogation sessions known as “Catharsis”.",
        "source": "1.06#2",
        "bg": "t12_iron_fist_behind_velvet_curtain",
        "camera": "pan",
        "dur_est": 3.92
      },
      {
        "id": "TK2.01#2",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.6,
        "text": "He systematically dismantled biological family loyalties, conditioning everyone to regard him alone as the ultimate benevolent father figure.",
        "source": "1.06#4",
        "bg": "t12_catharsis_session_interrogation",
        "camera": "push",
        "dur_est": 6.42
      },
      {
        "id": "TK2.01#3",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.6,
        "text": "He persuaded his followers to surrender their homes, sign over savings accounts, and divert government welfare checks directly into temple coffers.",
        "source": "1.06#5",
        "bg": "t12_property_surrender_passbooks",
        "camera": "still",
        "dur_est": 7.49
      },
      {
        "id": "TK2.01#4",
        "role": "N1",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.6,
        "text": "Imagine the mindset of a faithful devotee stepping for the very first time onto that remote soil in Guyana.",
        "source": "1.07#1",
        "bg": "t12_utopian_promise_mirage",
        "camera": "still",
        "dur_est": 6.53
      },
      {
        "id": "TK2.01#5",
        "role": "N1",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.6,
        "text": "Yet the moment we arrived at Jonestown, our passports and all personal funds were confiscated at the main entrance by temple leadership.",
        "source": "1.07#3",
        "bg": "t12_confiscated_passports_trunk",
        "camera": "pull",
        "dur_est": 7.56
      },
      {
        "id": "TK2.01#6",
        "role": "N1",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.6,
        "text": "Each day, we endured eleven grueling hours of manual farm labor under the sweltering equatorial sun, surviving on meager rations of rice and watery broth.",
        "source": "1.07#4",
        "bg": "t12_confiscated_passports_trunk",
        "camera": "push",
        "dur_est": 8.59
      },
      {
        "id": "TK2.01#7",
        "role": "N1",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.6,
        "text": "Armed security details patrolled the perimeter around the clock, carrying high-powered firearms.",
        "source": "1.07#5",
        "bg": "t12_equatorial_forced_labor_fields",
        "camera": "still",
        "dur_est": 4.12
      },
      {
        "id": "TK2.01#8",
        "role": "N1",
        "emotion": "sad",
        "speed": -0.04,
        "pause_after": 0.0,
        "text": "Maternal instinct warned me that a terrible catastrophe hung over my son, and I knew I had to find a way to escape at any cost.",
        "source": "1.07#8",
        "bg": "t12_inescapable_labor_camp_cage",
        "camera": "push",
        "dur_est": 8.93
      }
    ]
  },
  "TK3": {
    "title": "Groupthink & The Milgram Obedience Trap",
    "theme": "Obedience to Authority & Groupthink",
    "hook": "Why did 918 people walk into destruction without mass revolt? The anatomy of group obedience.",
    "total_dur_est": 52.4,
    "bgm": "bgm_piano_minimal.mp3",
    "sfx": [
      "amb_room_tone.wav (bed)",
      "fx_clock_ticking.wav",
      "fx_stinger.wav"
    ],
    "overlay": [
      {
        "after_id": "TK3.01#1",
        "text": "THE ULTIMATE QUESTION: WHY DID IT HAPPEN?",
        "dur_s": 2.5
      },
      {
        "after_id": "TK3.01#3",
        "text": "MILGRAM EXPERIMENT: SURRENDERING MORAL AGENCY",
        "dur_s": 3.0
      },
      {
        "after_id": "TK3.01#5",
        "text": "IRVING JANIS: GROUPTHINK DYSFUNCTION",
        "dur_s": 3.0
      },
      {
        "after_id": "TK3.01#7",
        "text": "FOOT-IN-THE-DOOR: ESCALATING COMMITMENT",
        "dur_s": 2.5
      },
      {
        "after_id": "TK3.01#8",
        "text": "THE PERFECT TRAP OF VOLUNTARY BLINDNESS",
        "dur_s": 3.0
      }
    ],
    "lines": [
      {
        "id": "TK3.01#1",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.5,
        "text": "Reflecting upon Jonestown, the central question that has haunted behavioral scientists for decades remains: Why?",
        "source": "3.02#1",
        "bg": "t12_unanswered_question_diorama",
        "camera": "pan",
        "dur_est": 5.35
      },
      {
        "id": "TK3.01#2",
        "role": "C",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.5,
        "text": "The foundational psychological mechanism governing Jonestown is obedience to authority, demonstrated in the landmark experiments of Stanley Milgram.",
        "source": "3.03#1",
        "bg": "t12_milgram_experiment_shock_generator",
        "camera": "push",
        "dur_est": 7.0
      },
      {
        "id": "TK3.01#3",
        "role": "C",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.5,
        "text": "Milgram demonstrated that when confronted with a figure perceived as a legitimate authority, individuals routinely surrender personal moral accountability.",
        "source": "3.03#2",
        "bg": "t12_milgram_experiment_shock_generator",
        "camera": "still",
        "dur_est": 7.39
      },
      {
        "id": "TK3.01#4",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.5,
        "text": "Beyond individual obedience, Jim Jones weaponized collective social pressure to extinguish independent thought.",
        "source": "3.04#1",
        "bg": "t12_groupthink_hostile_mob_shadows",
        "camera": "still",
        "dur_est": 4.64
      },
      {
        "id": "TK3.01#5",
        "role": "C",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.5,
        "text": "The concept of Groupthink, formulated by Irving Janis, explains how cohesive groups arrive at catastrophically irrational and destructive decisions.",
        "source": "3.05#1",
        "bg": "t12_cognitive_dissonance_scales",
        "camera": "pull",
        "dur_est": 7.39
      },
      {
        "id": "TK3.01#6",
        "role": "C",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.5,
        "text": "When the drive for internal unanimity overrides realistic appraisals of alternative courses of action, groups develop massive collective blindspots.",
        "source": "3.05#2",
        "bg": "t12_cognitive_dissonance_scales",
        "camera": "push",
        "dur_est": 7.39
      },
      {
        "id": "TK3.01#7",
        "role": "C",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.5,
        "text": "This distortion was reinforced through the Foot-in-the-Door technique, or escalation of commitment.",
        "source": "3.05#4",
        "bg": "t12_closed_circle_of_stools",
        "camera": "pan",
        "dur_est": 4.67
      },
      {
        "id": "TK3.01#8",
        "role": "C",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.0,
        "text": "It represents an escalating psychological trap that ensnares human beings in voluntary servitude.",
        "source": "3.05#13",
        "bg": "t12_staircase_into_blackness",
        "camera": "pull",
        "dur_est": 5.06
      }
    ]
  },
  "TK4": {
    "title": "Death Tape Q 042 & The Solitary Voice of Defiance",
    "theme": "Neutralization Theory & Independent Conscience",
    "hook": "The FBI's 44-minute declassified death tape. The lone woman who stood up to question the leader.",
    "total_dur_est": 64.4,
    "bgm": "bgm_violin_heart.mp3",
    "sfx": [
      "amb_tape_hiss.wav (bed)",
      "fx_cassette_play.wav",
      "fx_stinger.wav"
    ],
    "overlay": [
      {
        "after_id": "TK4.01#1",
        "text": "FBI DECLASSIFIED EVIDENCE: DEATH TAPE Q 042",
        "dur_s": 3.0
      },
      {
        "after_id": "TK4.01#2",
        "text": "44 MINUTES OF CHILLING HISTORICAL RECORDING",
        "dur_s": 2.5
      },
      {
        "after_id": "TK4.01#4",
        "text": "CHRISTINE MILLER (AGE 60): THE LONE DEFENDER",
        "dur_s": 3.0
      },
      {
        "after_id": "TK4.01#6",
        "text": "“AS LONG AS THERE’S LIFE, THERE’S HOPE”",
        "dur_s": 2.5
      },
      {
        "after_id": "TK4.01#8",
        "text": "INDEPENDENT CONSCIENCE DEFENDING INNOCENCE",
        "dur_s": 3.0
      }
    ],
    "lines": [
      {
        "id": "TK4.01#1",
        "role": "D",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.6,
        "text": "United States government archives subsequently declassified one of the most chilling evidentiary recordings in modern history: “Death Tape Q 042”.",
        "source": "2.11#1",
        "bg": "t12_knife_attack_scuffle_pavilion",
        "camera": "pull",
        "dur_est": 8.13
      },
      {
        "id": "TK4.01#2",
        "role": "D",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.6,
        "text": "This forty-four-minute cassette recording captures the raw audio landscape inside the central pavilion on the afternoon of November 18, 1978.",
        "source": "2.11#2",
        "bg": "t12_knife_attack_scuffle_pavilion",
        "camera": "push",
        "dur_est": 8.13
      },
      {
        "id": "TK4.01#3",
        "role": "D",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.6,
        "text": "On the tape, Jim Jones announces to the assembly that Congressman Ryan's party has been ambushed and that an aircraft is crashing into the jungle.",
        "source": "2.11#3",
        "bg": "t12_old_radio_receiver_dark",
        "camera": "still",
        "dur_est": 10.16
      },
      {
        "id": "TK4.01#4",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.6,
        "text": "That courageous individual was Christine Miller, an African American woman in her sixties who had dedicated years of service to the church.",
        "source": "4.04#1",
        "bg": "t12_miller_silhouette_at_microphone",
        "camera": "pull",
        "dur_est": 7.85
      },
      {
        "id": "TK4.01#5",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.6,
        "text": "Upon hearing Jones announce the collective end of the settlement, she stood and questioned the patriarch before the entire assembly.",
        "source": "4.04#2",
        "bg": "t12_miller_silhouette_at_microphone",
        "camera": "push",
        "dur_est": 7.14
      },
      {
        "id": "TK4.01#6",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "fearful",
        "speed": -0.03,
        "pause_after": 0.6,
        "text": "Her clear, unwavering words are preserved on the tape: “I feel that as long as there's life, there's hope.",
        "source": "4.04#3",
        "bg": "t12_empty_microphone_after_crowd",
        "camera": "still",
        "dur_est": 6.78
      },
      {
        "id": "TK4.01#7",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.6,
        "text": "Confronted by Christine Miller's principled reasoning, Jim Jones reacted with irritation and harsh dismissal.",
        "source": "4.06#1",
        "bg": "t12_raised_fist_behind_microphone",
        "camera": "still",
        "dur_est": 5.0
      },
      {
        "id": "TK4.01#8",
        "role": "C",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.0,
        "text": "Christine Miller's dissent exemplifies independent moral agency, breaking through collective fear to champion the sanctity of young life.",
        "source": "4.07#5",
        "bg": "t12_brass_compass_on_bare_table",
        "camera": "still",
        "dur_est": 7.0
      }
    ]
  },
