    "lines": [
      {
        "id": "TK5.01#1",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.5,
        "text": "To empower you and your loved ones to identify and avoid dangerous coercive traps in contemporary life, Amber eyes synthesizes four survival red flags derived from the Jonestown dossier.",
        "source": "5.05#1",
        "bg": "t12_amber_eyes_closing_dossier_jonestown",
        "camera": "pan",
        "dur_est": 10.35
      },
      {
        "id": "TK5.01#2",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.4,
        "text": "Red Flag Number One: Demands for total isolation from your established social support network.",
        "source": "5.05#2",
        "bg": "t12_redflag1_total_social_isolation",
        "camera": "pull",
        "dur_est": 5.0
      },
      {
        "id": "TK5.01#3",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.5,
        "text": "They deliberately detach you from objective reality to establish their authority as the sole arbiter of your worldview.",
        "source": "5.05#4",
        "bg": "t12_redflag2_silenced_critical_thinking",
        "camera": "still",
        "dur_est": 6.42
      },
      {
        "id": "TK5.01#4",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.4,
        "text": "Red Flag Number Two: Financial usurpation and the confiscation of personal autonomy assets.",
        "source": "5.05#5",
        "bg": "t12_redflag3_escalating_commitment_trap",
        "camera": "pan",
        "dur_est": 4.64
      },
      {
        "id": "TK5.01#5",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.5,
        "text": "When you lose financial independence and mobility, you surrender the practical capacity to escape when anomalies surface.",
        "source": "5.05#7",
        "bg": "t12_empty_trunk_open_padlock",
        "camera": "push",
        "dur_est": 6.07
      },
      {
        "id": "TK5.01#6",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.4,
        "text": "Red Flag Number Three: Engineered physical depletion designed to dismantle critical thinking.",
        "source": "5.05#8",
        "bg": "t12_exhausted_worker_hut_wall",
        "camera": "still",
        "dur_est": 4.28
      },
      {
        "id": "TK5.01#7",
        "role": "H",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "speed": -0.02,
        "pause_after": 0.5,
        "text": "When the human body is pushed to exhaustion, the brain's natural skepticism and resistance reflexes become severely degraded.",
        "source": "5.05#10",
        "bg": "t12_sleep_deprived_bare_bunk",
        "camera": "pull",
        "dur_est": 6.42
      },
      {
